  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$150, 5,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a>, 50x <a href=\"/index.php/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">steel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$1300\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>40x <a href=\"/index.php/Bauxite\" title=\"Bauxite\">bauxite</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>25 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\n<td>96x <a href=\"/index.php/Bauxite\" title=\"Bauxite\">bauxite</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$9.6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/hour</b></td>\n<td>$576\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return On Investment</b></td>\n<td>0.738%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Aliases</b></td>\n<td>bauxite mine, bauxitemine\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The Bauxite mine is used to mine <a href=\"/index.php/Bauxite\" title=\"Bauxite\">Bauxite</a> which can be used in the production of <a href=\"/index.php/Aluminum\" title=\"Aluminum\">Aluminum</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Bauxite_mine&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>As input</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Aluminum_factory\" title=\"Aluminum factory\">Aluminum factory</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008193644\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2